# 跨平台换行约定：仓库内统一 LF，检出到 Windows 也不转换。
# Rust / Node / Tauri 工具链都能正确处理 LF，避免 CRLF 引起无谓 diff。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理脚本保留 CRLF，否则 cmd 解析可能出问题
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件不做文本转换
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.zip binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.a binary
*.lib binary
*.pdb binary
